00:08:45.727 --> 00:08:47.933
I did it, I'm the best drinker officially.

00:08:47.933 --> 00:08:50.572
Hey, it's me in the mirror.

00:08:50.572 --> 00:08:52.453
(groaning)

00:08:52.453 --> 00:08:54.008
- Good morning hangover.

00:08:54.008 --> 00:08:55.518
- Oh my God I'm melting.

00:08:55.518 --> 00:08:56.493
- Why am I awake?

00:08:56.493 --> 00:08:58.025
- I have to go to the airport

00:08:58.025 --> 00:09:00.004
and I think I'm still drunk, oh no.

00:09:00.004 --> 00:09:01.049
- Pretty usual, I feel fine.

00:09:01.049 --> 00:09:04.128
- 0.012, I am still drunk.

00:09:04.128 --> 00:09:06.875
- I feel even better because
I remember everything,

00:09:06.875 --> 00:09:08.929
and I stayed with my
friends the entire time.

00:09:13.132 --> 00:09:15.010
- What I've learned through
this entire experience

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:17.396
is that alcohol is poison
and my body hates it.

00:09:17.396 --> 00:09:19.019
- [Eugene] You can get
too drunk on anything.

00:09:19.019 --> 00:09:20.218
And that's just not safe.

00:09:20.218 --> 00:09:21.843
- [Ned] You can have fun without alcohol.

00:09:21.843 --> 00:09:23.732
- But if you are gonna drink,

00:09:23.732 --> 00:09:27.099
make sure you're doing it
in a situation that's safe.

00:09:27.099 --> 00:09:29.281
Make sure that you're not gonna drive.

00:09:29.281 --> 00:09:30.535
Don't drink alone.

00:09:30.535 --> 00:09:31.487
- Drink at your own pace.

00:09:31.487 --> 00:09:32.416
- Drink responsibly.

00:09:32.416 --> 00:09:33.940
- Know your limits, don't push them.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.502
- There's no point in
having fun and drinking

00:09:35.502 --> 00:09:36.637
if you can't remember any of it.

00:09:36.637 --> 00:09:38.000
- Don't get too (bleep) up.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:39.626
But get a little (bleep) up.

00:09:39.626 --> 00:09:41.502
- [Zach] DADS are Day
After Drinking (bleep).

00:09:41.502 --> 00:09:43.018
- [Dr.Keith] The natural
response of the body

00:09:43.018 --> 00:09:44.250
is to try to get that out.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.968
So both ends start to go.

00:09:45.968 --> 00:09:48.238
- DADS are at like a level ten.

